{"4955330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Morder", "steam_appid": 4955330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What does the murderer do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The murderer is supposed to get one kill per round and can use an array of weapons to use to kill the innocents. The murderer is assigned a target at the beginning and if the murderer kills somebody else then they lose. The murderer also has to worry about cleaning the crime scene to get rid of as much evidence as possible. This game is also a social deduction, so the murderer has to argue their way out of losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/f51baca94e6b9ab499650a0122941fc6.poster.avif?t=1786560306\" width=506 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/f51baca94e6b9ab499650a0122941fc6.webm?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/f51baca94e6b9ab499650a0122941fc6.mp4?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What does the detective do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The detective can use traps and tools to help find who the murderer is. The detective can also interrogate players to see who the murderer is. The detective then suspects who they think it is and they will see whether or not they made the right choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/eb4138594539e9a95f4f58d7849f2766.poster.avif?t=1786560306\" width=506 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/eb4138594539e9a95f4f58d7849f2766.webm?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/eb4138594539e9a95f4f58d7849f2766.mp4?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What do the innocents do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The innocents can help the detective conclude who the murderer is, but the detective has the final say. They have to do activities to make money. Each player has a hunger bar and if they can buy food in the shop using money to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/d09604e851d3d8c7caba0e18e28d2e8e.poster.avif?t=1786560306\" width=506 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/d09604e851d3d8c7caba0e18e28d2e8e.webm?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/d09604e851d3d8c7caba0e18e28d2e8e.mp4?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is featured in this game?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll and the ability to drag bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flamethrower that can start fires</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot machines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is required for this game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-12 players needed</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microphone for proximity voice chat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends (Sorry if you don't have any. Alternatively you can play on public lobbies.)</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What does the murderer do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The murderer is supposed to get one kill per round and can use an array of weapons to use to kill the innocents. The murderer is assigned a target at the beginning and if the murderer kills somebody else then they lose. The murderer also has to worry about cleaning the crime scene to get rid of as much evidence as possible. This game is also a social deduction, so the murderer has to argue their way out of losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/f51baca94e6b9ab499650a0122941fc6.poster.avif?t=1786560306\" width=506 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/f51baca94e6b9ab499650a0122941fc6.webm?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955330/extras/f51baca94e6b9ab499650a0122941fc6.mp4?t=1786560306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What does the detective do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The detective can use traps and tools to help find who the murderer is. The detective can also interrogate players to see who the murderer is. The detective then suspects who they think it is and they will see whether or not they made the right choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"